            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to MS. CAMPBELL, petitioner argues that passengers have a liberty interest in free travel, citing Delaware v. Prouse."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MR. ZALL",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1a81ac5b64a019dd75a5f3c849fb110f428b8e260b5a487e2add7b75973d29a9",
