            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to MR. ZALL, petitioner contends that the presence of an arrest warrant attenuates any taint, making the evidence not suppressible."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Clifford E. Zall",
        "citations": [
          {
