            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Clifford E. Zall, respondent argues that the situation does not result in a seizure of a passenger."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MR. ZALL",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1a81ac5b64a019dd75a5f3c849fb110f428b8e260b5a487e2add7b75973d29a9",
            "evidence_ids": [
